<title>FRANCE: France Telecom studies stock-options.</title>
<headline>France Telecom studies stock-options.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>France Telecom said on Wednesday that it would in the second half of the year establish a stock option plan for a large number of managers, a spokesman said.</p>
<p>&quot;It is still in a study stage, the supervisory board has not decided on it,&quot; the spokesman said.</p>
<p>France Telecom is in the process of being partially privatised in a share sale through which the government aims to raise between 30 and 50 billion francs.</p>
</text>
